@startuml C4-Dynamic-Globe-Bootstrap
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — Globe bootstrap (createGlobe → dispose)

actor "Browser User" as user
participant "Theme Page\n(React)" as page <<ui>>
participant "createGlobe\n(infra/three)" as globe
participant "addLandDots" as land
participant "createArc" as arc
participant "WebGL Canvas" as canvas

user -> page: 1. Open /globe-light or /globe-dark
page -> globe: 2. createGlobe(container, canvas, { theme, colors })
globe -> land: 3. addLandDots(scene, material, config)
land --> globe: 4. materials[]
globe -> arc: 5. createArc / createMarker (per DEFAULT_ROUTES)
arc --> globe: 6. meshes
globe -> canvas: 7. requestAnimationFrame render
globe --> page: 8. GlobeHandle { materials, state, dispose }
page --> user: 9. Interactive globe

note right of page
  On unmount: handle.dispose()
  stops rAF and removes listeners
end note

user -> page: 10. Leave route / unmount
page -> globe: 11. dispose()

@enduml
